text.section:
The Commission shall not issue to any licensee a recreational gear license that exceeds the following limitations:

One gill net up to 300 feet in length, $7.50;


Up to 10 crab pots with turtle excluder devices, $36; up to 10 crab pots without turtle excluder devices, $46;


One crab trap or crab pound, $5;


One crab scrape, $16; or


Two eel pots, $10.
